place a glass tube on the right two-armed scale\n4. shrink down and enter the portal to the right side of the left scale\n5. make a fire\n6. go outside through the portal \n7. observe the left scale from outside.\n8. enter the open portal to the right\n9. start a fire\n10. use the portal to go outside.\n11. go outside and observe the scales on both arms\n<Result \n- Burning wood, charcoal, and candles: Burning wood, charcoal, and candles produces water vapor and carbon dioxide.", "short_description": "Explore the fundamental principle of mass conservation in chemical reactions. This experiment demonstrates that the mass of reactants equals the mass of products, a cornerstone concept in chemistry."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8522191397888545"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031319_1351650025546529_6650435794833083198_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mXnu_LYEDpUQ7kNvwHOMrhJ&_nc_oc=AdnnbL8sc2qc